ncies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Currently secondary index does not support IN predicate and will return empty results:\r\n\r\n```\r\npostgres=# create table t (k int primary key, v int);\r\nCREATE TABLE\r\npostgres=# create index on t (v);\r\nCREATE INDEX\r\npostgres=# insert into t values (1, 2);\r\nINSERT 0 1\r\npostgres=# insert into t values (3, 4);\r\nINSERT 0 1\r\npostgres=# select * from t where v = 2 or v = 4;\r\n k | v\r\n---+---\r\n 1 | 2\r\n 3 | 4\r\n(2 rows)\r\n\r\npostgres=# select * from t where v in (2, 4);\r\n k | v\r\n---+---\r\n(0 rows)\r\n\r\npostgres=# explain select * from t where v in (2, 4);\r\n                             QUERY PLAN\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n Index Scan using t_v_idx on t  (cost=0.00..4.01 rows=1000 width=8)\r\n   Index Cond: (v = ANY ('{2,4}'::integer[]))\r\n(2 rows)\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"ndeodhar","id":15746068,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzQ2MDY4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15746068?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar","html_url":"https://github.com/ndeodhar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/995/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"